Anwa taɣanant tuklalt i irgazen? Taɣanant n uzweɣ.
Anwa taxsayt tḥemmlen ugar tinegdit? Taxsayt n idrimen.
D acu-t tazmert d-yettwaḥeqqen deg uzweɛ? Sḍiṣ ɛecra d tmanya, axaṭer deg 70 ad ilin d amennuɣ.
D acu igerrzen gar tudert d uɣanim? D imecṭaḥ, ilan, ihi tameṭṭut terra-ten d ijehden.
D acu-tent temsal tuklalen? Ḥsab d ujeǧǧig!
D acu-ay-tefkeḍ akked usebbaḍ n Disney? Idmaren n uwennag.
D acu-t itebbεen gar sin imcumen n uzweɛ akked kraḍ n tinegdit? Tabburt n Ṭṭayara.
Teẓriḍ acuɣer werǧin ttwaliɣ afilm n imcumen? Axaṭer dima lliɣ deg tama nniḍen n takamiṛa.
Teẓriḍ amek ara tesseḥbes tameṭṭut snat n tikkal deg uzweɛ? Tamezwarut m'ara terr ɣef deffir, tis snat m'ara isseḥbes aɣanim ɣef tsatuyt!
Teẓriḍ belli yiwen umaru yura tira n imcumen? Yal win iḥemmlen tigi tɣur-it yakan.
Ma d asfaḍ d amenɣay... tenfaḍ, d acu-tt? D tanmegla?
Ma tekcemeḍ ɣer Jack... nezmer ad d-nini teqqneḍ tibratin?
Ma yiwen amaziɣ ibɣa ad iyi-yaɣ s wallal? Zemreɣ ad iniɣ yesderɣel-iyi?
Ma yiwen umeɣnas n rap yerẓa yemma-s, d acu ixeddem umsebrid? Yebna taqidunt n xali-s!
Yemma-inek tecba am uleεb n tikwal. Turaren iwakken ad d-tawi idrimen...
Teẓriḍ ccna n tferḍest n uɣanim? Ihi, tikkelt-nniḍen, ɣas ma tesbelεḍ, kkemmet.
Teẓriḍ d acu-t aslakan? D asnulfu ara yeqqim deg umezruy.
Teẓriḍ umgired gar izmarn d nekk? Xilaf i izmarn, nekk kemmleɣ ad k-fesyeɣ, ɣas m'ara iyi-teznḍeḍ.
Tebɣiḍ ad teẓreḍ amkan-iw n icnayen? D Tinder!
Yiwen weqcic yenna i yemma-s: Yemma, yemma, sɛiɣ 20 ass-agi! Tebɣiḍ, seg wanwa? Seg usbeḥbeḥ.
Yiwen wergaz yesteqsa tameṭṭut ɣef umahil-is, tameṭṭut terra-yas: D taɛeddayt. Argaz yesteqsa: Deg wanwa umuɣ? Tameṭṭut terra-yas: D taɛeddayt n webrid!
Yiwet n tanfelt taqbuṛt tenna: Wid ittemsisen zdat waḍu... ad ilin s texxamt teqqnen.
Yiwet n tmeslimt tesserḍi argaz-is deg wass n Ṛamḍan. Ḥader a ḥbibi, ilaq ad terjuḍ tameddit uqbel ad tesbelεeḍ!
Yiwet n teqcict tenna i gma-s: Teẓriḍ tettemsiseḍ akter n baba? Ẓriɣ, yemma tenna-yi-t yakan...
Yiwet n tikkelt msiseɣ asaεet d xemsa n tesdatin. D ass n ubeddel n usaεet!
Talaqqaḍt d taḥanuḍt tamecṭuḥt, taεebbuḍt d taεebbuḍt tamecṭuḥt. D acu-t tazekkart tamecṭuḥt? Tamcum tamecṭuḥt.
Aɣanim ameqqran ara d-yesmekti asfaḍ yelhan... ad iqqim deg umezruy.
Yiwet n teqcict tamecṭuḥt testeqsa baba-s: Baba, baba, d acu-t "aẓekki n taḥemmalt"? Baba yerra-yas: Ilaq ad iyi-testeqsiḍ iḍelli, sɛiɣ-t ɣef yiles-iw!
Tiwlaft n usmel tecba am uɣanim. M'ara yili d amecṭuḥ, ur tettwaliḍ ara ma yelha.
Tinegdit tecba am Dracula... Tedder s wesfaḍ!
Taselult d yemma zznunt deg teflukt, yiwet tɣelli ɣer waman. Anta? Taselult, axaṭer tuggad.
Ad tzenzeḍ yiwen d am ukcum s ddreε... Tkecmeḍ s ddreε, tesserẓaḍ kullec.
Teẓriḍ acuɣer teqcicin n ulεab ḥemmlent aṭas ilεaben n uzemmul akked iselkimen? Axaṭer ḥemmlent tigabaytin!
Yemma, yemma, amek i yi-tsnulfaḍ? Yeεna, aṭas n medden i yεawnen deg-s.
Melmi ara yeḍru ugur ɣer tayaziṭ ugar? M'ara tettεeddi seg yajaǧaǧ ɣer weɣyul.
Amek ara tesnetteḍ aserwal n Dark Vador? S tama-s taberkant.
D acu-t asneqḍi n uɛeqli ijehden? Iwakken ad tili yelha, m'ara yili uzekki-inek deg tferḍest!
